@startgantt
' House preamble for DATED timelines only. Every bar or milestone needs a date the
' source states; undated steps go in a note marked "no date", never on the time axis.
' Start a timeline as this file followed by templates/skeleton-gantt.puml; edit only below the end marker.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
ganttDiagram {
  task { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD; LineColor #555555 }
  milestone { BackgroundColor #555555 }
}
</style>
printscale weekly
' house-preamble-end
